功法 Meditation &amp; Exercise</category><category>养生堂 Health Tutorials</category></item><item><title>这次才发现，静坐的修复能力那么强...</title><link>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/excercise/%E8%BF%99%E6%AC%A1%E6%89%8D%E5%8F%91%E7%8E%B0-%E9%9D%99%E5%9D%90%E7%9A%84%E4%BF%AE%E5%A4%8D%E8%83%BD%E5%8A%9B%E9%82%A3%E4%B9%88%E5%BC%BA/</link><pubDate>Tue, 19 Nov 2024 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><atom:modified>Tue, 19 Nov 2024 00:00:00 +0000</atom:modified><guid>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/excercise/%E8%BF%99%E6%AC%A1%E6%89%8D%E5%8F%91%E7%8E%B0-%E9%9D%99%E5%9D%90%E7%9A%84%E4%BF%AE%E5%A4%8D%E8%83%BD%E5%8A%9B%E9%82%A3%E4%B9%88%E5%BC%BA/</guid><description>昨夜发现颈下淋巴肿大，一颗。 这两天外感，晚上有扎针等治疗。但今早起来静坐之前，觉得淋巴没有变小。静坐的时候，一过性右手腕内侧刺麻感，面部有点</description><dc:creator>Dao of Healing</dc:creator><media:content url="https://www.daoofhealing.org//img/%e8%bf%99%e6%ac%a1%e6%89%8d%e5%8f%91%e7%8e%b0%20%e9%9d%99%e5%9d%90%e7%9a%84%e4%bf%ae%e5%a4%8d%e8%83%bd%e5%8a%9b%e9%82%a3%e4%b9%88%e5%bc%ba.assets/640.jpeg" medium="image"><media:title type="html">featured image</media:title></media:content><category>站桩</category><category>静坐</category><category>站桩打坐</category><category>养生功法 Meditation &amp; Exercise</category><category>养生堂 Health Tutorials</category></item><item><title>我的练功心得：百日筑基 —— 迈出成功的第一步</title><link>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/excercise/%E6%88%91%E7%9A%84%E7%BB%83%E5%8A%9F%E5%BF%83%E5%BE%97-%E7%99%BE%E6%97%A5%E7%AD%91%E5%9F%BA-%E8%BF%88%E5%87%BA%E6%88%90%E5%8A%9F%E7%9A%84%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%80%E6%AD%A5/</link><pubDate>Wed, 30 Oct 2024 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><atom:modified>Wed, 30 Oct 2024 00:00:00 +0000</atom:modified><guid>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/excercise/%E6%88%91%E7%9A%84%E7%BB%83%E5%8A%9F%E5%BF%83%E5%BE%97-%E7%99%BE%E6%97%A5%E7%AD%91%E5%9F%BA-%E8%BF%88%E5%87%BA%E6%88%90%E5%8A%9F%E7%9A%84%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%80%E6%AD%A5/</guid><description>今天无意翻到笔记本第一页开营记录的日期，发现不知不觉中已加入站桩群过百日了。 曾经无数次想要自己好好做一次百日筑基，修复身心，但从没真正成功过</description><dc:creator>Dao of Healing</dc:creator><media:content url="https://www.daoofhealing.org//img/%e6%88%91%e7%9a%84%e7%bb%83%e5%8a%9f%e5%bf%83%e5%be%97%20%e7%99%be%e6%97%a5%e7%ad%91%e5%9f%ba%20%20%e8%bf%88%e5%87%ba%e6%88%90%e5%8a%9f%e7%9a%84%e7%ac%ac%e4%b8%80%e6%ad%a5.assets/image-20241124111214860.png" medium="image"><media:title type="html">featured image</media:title></media:content><category>站桩</category><category>静坐</category><category>站桩打坐</category><category>养生功法 Meditation &amp; Exercise</category><category>养生堂 Health Tutorials</category></item><item><title>神奇功法：医院复查，肺活量提升20%，睡觉更舒服...</title><link>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/excercise/%E7%A5%9E%E5%A5%87%E5%8A%9F%E6%B3%95-%E5%8C%BB%E9%99%A2%E5%A4%8D%E6%9F%A5-%E8%82%BA%E6%B4%BB%E9%87%8F%E6%8F%90%E5%8D%8720-%E7%9D%A1%E8%A7%89%E6%9B%B4%E8%88%92%E6%9C%8D/</link><pubDate>Fri, 18 Oct 2024 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><atom:modified>Fri, 18 Oct 2024 00:00:00 +0000</atom:modified><guid>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/excercise/%E7%A5%9E%E5%A5%87%E5%8A%9F%E6%B3%95-%E5%8C%BB%E9%99%A2%E5%A4%8D%E6%9F%A5-%E8%82%BA%E6%B4%BB%E9%87%8F%E6%8F%90%E5%8D%8720-%E7%9D%A1%E8%A7%89%E6%9B%B4%E8%88%92%E6%9C%8D/</guid><description>一位饱受病苦的患者 这是一位从小就饱受病苦的患者：小小年纪，身体做了无数次手术。有些二次伤害，可能导致终身问题。 从胸椎到脑部有多达几十颗的钢钉</description><dc:creator>Dao of Healing</dc:creator><media:content url="https://www.daoofhealing.org//img/%e5%88%86%e4%ba%ab%20%e5%b0%8f%e5%8c%bb%e7%94%9f%e5%b8%a6%e9%a2%86%e7%be%a4%e5%8f%8b%e4%bb%ac%e7%ab%99%e6%a1%a9.assets/image-20231010170446195.png" medium="image"><media:title type="html">featured image</media:title></media:content><category>站桩</category><category>静坐</category><category>站桩打坐</category><category>养生功法 Meditation &amp; Exercise</category><category>养生堂 Health Tutorials</category></item><item><title>小功法大能量</title><link>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/excercise/%E5%B0%8F%E5%8A%9F%E6%B3%95%E5%A4%A7%E8%83%BD%E9%87%8F/</link><pubDate>Sun, 01 Sep 2024 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><atom:modified>Sun, 01 Sep 2024 00:00:00 +0000</atom:modified><guid>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/excercise/%E5%B0%8F%E5%8A%9F%E6%B3%95%E5%A4%A7%E8%83%BD%E9%87%8F/</guid><description>随着三伏天结束，线上辟谷共修营暂时告一段落。从实践反馈中可以看出，大家对我们的辟谷法都有非常好的感受与认知，在身心等各方面也均有不同程度的受</description><dc:creator>Dao of Healing</dc:creator><media:content url="https://www.daoofhealing.org//img/%e5%b0%8f%e5%8a%9f%e6%b3%95%e5%a4%a7%e8%83%bd%e9%87%8f.assets/640.png" medium="image"><media:title type="html">featured image</media:title></media:content><category>站桩</category><category>静坐</category><category>养生功法 Meditation &amp; Exercise</category><category>养生堂 Health Tutorials</category></item><item><title>这是我前行最大的动力</title><link>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/excercise/%E8%BF%99%E6%98%AF%E6%88%91%E5%89%8D%E8%A1%8C%E6%9C%80%E5%A4%A7%E7%9A%84%E5%8A%A8%E5%8A%9B/</link><pubDate>Wed, 24 Jul 2024 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><atom:modified>Wed, 24 Jul 2024 00:00:00 +0000</atom:modified><guid>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/excercise/%E8%BF%99%E6%98%AF%E6%88%91%E5%89%8D%E8%A1%8C%E6%9C%80%E5%A4%A7%E7%9A%84%E5%8A%A8%E5%8A%9B/</guid><description>昨天晚上共修，站桩的时候不仅气感明显，督脉和膀胱经明显的感觉到酥酥麻麻的气流穿过。 在此前一周，由于背部扎针时不注意，受凉了。导致第二天早上起</description><dc:creator>Dao of Healing</dc:creator><media:content url="https://www.daoofhealing.org//img/%e8%bf%99%e6%98%af%e6%88%91%e5%89%8d%e8%a1%8c%e6%9c%80%e5%a4%a7%e7%9a%84%e5%8a%a8%e5%8a%9b.assets/640.jpeg" medium="image"><media:title type="html">featured image</media:title></media:content><category>站桩</category><category>静坐</category><category>养生功法 Meditation &amp; Exercise</category><category>养生堂 Health Tutorials</category></item><item><title>分享 | 小医生带领群友们站桩</title><link>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/excercise/%E5%88%86%E4%BA%AB-%E5%B0%8F%E5%8C%BB%E7%94%9F%E5%B8%A6%E9%A2%86%E7%BE%A4%E5%8F%8B%E4%BB%AC%E7%AB%99%E6%A1%A9/</link><pubDate>Mon, 09 Oct 2023 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><atom:modified>Mon, 09 Oct 2023 00:00:00 +0000</atom:modified><guid>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/excercise/%E5%88%86%E4%BA%AB-%E5%B0%8F%E5%8C%BB%E7%94%9F%E5%B8%A6%E9%A2%86%E7%BE%A4%E5%8F%8B%E4%BB%AC%E7%AB%99%E6%A1%A9/</guid><description>天得一清，地得一宁，人得一灵。 能够自觉觉察自我，关照内外，坦然、安然和欣然面对当下的种种身体反应，不怀疑、不提问、不害怕、不追求、不执着。认</description><dc:creator>Dao of Healing</dc:creator><media:content url="https://www.daoofhealing.org//img/%e5%88%86%e4%ba%ab%20%e5%b0%8f%e5%8c%bb%e7%94%9f%e5%b8%a6%e9%a2%86%e7%be%a4%e5%8f%8b%e4%bb%ac%e7%ab%99%e6%a1%a9.assets/image-20231010170446195.png" medium="image"><media:title type="html">featured image</media:title></media:content><category>站桩</category><category>静坐</category><category>养生功法 Meditation &amp; Exercise</category><category>养生堂 Health Tutorials</category></item><item><title>“静坐是一个很好的开始，教我们逐渐认识自己，练习敞开。”</title><link>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/cultivation/%E9%9D%99%E5%9D%90%E6%98%AF%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%AA%E5%BE%88%E5%A5%BD%E7%9A%84%E5%BC%80%E5%A7%8B-%E6%95%99%E6%88%91%E4%BB%AC%E9%80%90%E6%B8%90%E8%AE%A4%E8%AF%86%E8%87%AA%E5%B7%B1-%E7%BB%83%E4%B9%A0%E6%95%9E%E5%BC%80/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jun 2020 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><atom:modified>Mon, 01 Jun 2020 00:00:00 +0000</atom:modified><guid>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/cultivation/%E9%9D%99%E5%9D%90%E6%98%AF%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%AA%E5%BE%88%E5%A5%BD%E7%9A%84%E5%BC%80%E5%A7%8B-%E6%95%99%E6%88%91%E4%BB%AC%E9%80%90%E6%B8%90%E8%AE%A4%E8%AF%86%E8%87%AA%E5%B7%B1-%E7%BB%83%E4%B9%A0%E6%95%9E%E5%BC%80/</guid><description>以下文章来源于菩提洲网站 ，作者希阿荣博堪布 正念的修行可以以一切经历为观照对象，但这并不意味着我们可以不经过任何心灵训练，自然而然地掌握正念的</description><dc:creator>Dao of Healing</dc:creator><media:content url="https://www.daoofhealing.org//img/%e9%9d%99%e5%9d%90%e6%98%af%e4%b8%80%e4%b8%aa%e5%be%88%e5%a5%bd%e7%9a%84%e5%bc%80%e5%a7%8b%ef%bc%8c%e6%95%99%e6%88%91%e4%bb%ac%e9%80%90%e6%b8%90%e8%ae%a4%e8%af%86%e8%87%aa%e5%b7%b1%20%20%e7%bb%83%e4%b9%a0%e6%95%9e%e5%bc%80.assets/image-20230514201135502.png" medium="image"><media:title type="html">featured image</media:title></media:content><category>修心</category><category>静坐</category><category>禅定</category><category>改命 Cultivation</category></item><item><title>健康还是财富</title><link>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/cultivation/%E5%81%A5%E5%BA%B7%E8%BF%98%E6%98%AF%E8%B4%A2%E5%AF%8C/</link><pubDate>Wed, 23 Aug 2017 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><atom:modified>Wed, 23 Aug 2017 00:00:00 +0000</atom:modified><guid>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/cultivation/%E5%81%A5%E5%BA%B7%E8%BF%98%E6%98%AF%E8%B4%A2%E5%AF%8C/</guid><description>如果有人出1个亿买你的命，请原谅我如此这么粗鲁的提车这么个问题，但现在真的人在卖自己的命除非家里遇到重大变故或者其他特殊原因，一般的人不会卖</description><dc:creator>Dao of Healing</dc:creator><media:content url="https://www.daoofhealing.org//img/%e5%81%a5%e5%ba%b7%e8%bf%98%e6%98%af%e8%b4%a2%e5%af%8c.assets/image-20221226145003278.png" medium="image"><media:title type="html">featured image</media:title></media:content><category>静坐</category><category>站桩</category><category>改命 Cultivation</category><category>中医养生 TCM Health Tips</category><category>养生堂 Health Tutorials</category><category>改命 Cultivation</category></item><item><title>立秋之后的保养--动</title><link>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/tcm/%E7%AB%8B%E7%A7%8B%E4%B9%8B%E5%90%8E%E7%9A%84%E4%BF%9D%E5%85%BB--%E5%8A%A8/</link><pubDate>Tue, 22 Aug 2017 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><atom:modified>Tue, 22 Aug 2017 00:00:00 +0000</atom:modified><guid>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/tcm/%E7%AB%8B%E7%A7%8B%E4%B9%8B%E5%90%8E%E7%9A%84%E4%BF%9D%E5%85%BB--%E5%8A%A8/</guid><description>运动调养：静中修动 流水不腐户枢不蠹，人体本身就是一个活动的小宇宙，一动一静都不外顺应天地、宇宙，那么我们立秋之后如何动呢？秋季养生不能离开“</description><dc:creator>Dao of Healing</dc:creator><media:content url="https://www.daoofhealing.org//img/%e7%ab%8b%e7%a7%8b%e4%b9%8b%e5%90%8e%e7%9a%84%e4%bf%9d%e5%85%bb--%e5%8a%a8.assets/image-20221229180824287.png" medium="image"><media:title type="html">featured image</media:title></media:content><category>立秋</category><category>养生</category><category>散步</category><category>静坐</category><category>中医养生 TCM Health Tips</category><category>养生堂 Health Tutorials</category></item><item><title>不负春光，一起练太极甩掉肉肉吧！</title><link>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/excercise/%E4%B8%8D%E8%B4%9F%E6%98%A5%E5%85%89%E4%B8%80%E8%B5%B7%E7%BB%83%E5%A4%AA%E6%9E%81%E7%94%A9%E6%8E%89%E8%82%89%E8%82%89%E5%90%A7/</link><pubDate>Tue, 18 Apr 2017 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><atom:modified>Tue, 18 Apr 2017 00:00:00 +0000</atom:modified><guid>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/excercise/%E4%B8%8D%E8%B4%9F%E6%98%A5%E5%85%89%E4%B8%80%E8%B5%B7%E7%BB%83%E5%A4%AA%E6%9E%81%E7%94%A9%E6%8E%89%E8%82%89%E8%82%89%E5%90%A7/</guid><description>漫长的多伦多冬季终于过去了，是不是抓心扰肺的想出去玩耍，但又不知道干什么？是不是想赶紧把一个冬天存下来的肥膘甩掉，但又不想在闭塞的gym里挥</description><dc:creator>Dao of Healing</dc:creator><media:content url="https://www.daoofhealing.org//img/%e4%b8%8d%e8%b4%9f%e6%98%a5%e5%85%89%ef%bc%8c%e4%b8%80%e8%b5%b7%e7%bb%83%e5%a4%aa%e6%9e%81%e7%94%a9%e6%8e%89%e8%82%89%e8%82%89%e5%90%a7!.assets/image-20221226145500232.png" medium="image"><media:title type="html">featured image</media:title></media:content><category>静坐</category><category>站桩</category><category>养生功法 Meditation &amp; Exercise</category><category>养生堂 Health Tutorials</category></item></channel></rss>